#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:1
msgid "E4219"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `invalid_export_name`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`invalid_export_name`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `#export_name` attribute is invalid. MoonBit currently requires "
"exported names to be unique valid C symbol identifiers for every backend."
" This is a known compiler issue: the attribute applies this cross-backend"
" restriction even though WebAssembly export names themselves are UTF-8 "
"strings and are not limited to C identifiers. The attribute may be used "
"only on public, non-generic function definitions without optional "
"arguments in a foreign-library package."
msgstr ""
"`#export_name` 属性无效。MoonBit 目前要求所有后端的导出名都是唯一且有效的 C 符号标识符。这是一个已知的编译器问题：尽管 "
"WebAssembly 导出名本身是 UTF-8 字符串，并不限于 C "
"标识符，该属性仍会施加这一跨后端限制。该属性只能用于外部库包中无可选参数的公开、非泛型函数定义。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#export_name(\"bad-name\")\n"
"pub fn add_one(value : Int) -> Int {\n"
"  value + 1\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:20
msgid ""
"Use a valid symbol name and declare the package as a foreign library with"
" `pkgtype(kind: \"foreign_library\")`."
msgstr "使用有效的符号名称，并通过 `pkgtype(kind: \"foreign_library\")` 将包声明为外部库。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:23
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#export_name(\"add_one\")\n"
"pub fn add_one(value : Int) -> Int {\n"
"  value + 1\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
